  "solution": {
    "text": "Given, modulating frequency $f_m$ $=15 \\mathrm{KHz}$\n$\\therefore \\quad$ Bandwidth of one channel $=2 f_m=30 \\mathrm{kHz}$\n$\\therefore \\quad$ No of channels accommodate\n$$\n=\\frac{300 \\mathrm{kHz}}{30 \\mathrm{kHz}}=10\n$$",
